## 2. BUG CATEGORIES

Document findings with these categories:

| Category | What to Check |
|----------|---------------|
| **Null Safety** | Array access `[0]`, filter results, chained `.` access |
| **Configuration** | Flow name mismatches, initialState references, property bindings |
| **Naming** | Typos in file names, inconsistent conventions |
| **Error Handling** | Missing handlers, scatter-gather route failures, catch-all gaps |
| **Data Validation** | Missing input validation, sizeOf() on wrong types |
| **Type Safety** | Type mismatches, coercion without defaults, `contains` on wrong types |
| **Code Quality** | Hardcoded values, inefficient patterns, duplicate code |
| **Test Coverage** | Missing MUnit tests, untested flows, low coverage |
| **Security** | Hardcoded secrets, PII in logs, missing HTTPS |

---

## 3. DATAWEAVE BUG PATTERNS

| Pattern | Example | Severity |
|---------|---------|----------|
| Filter result `[0]` | `(array filter cond)[0]` | CRITICAL |
| Direct array access | `payload.items[0]` | CRITICAL |
| Array slice | `array[1 to -1]` | CRITICAL |
| Nested array | `contacts[0].emails[0]` | CRITICAL |
| Coercion no default | `value as Number` | HIGH |
| `~=` on null | `field ~= "true"` | HIGH |
| `contains` wrong type | `arr contains "x"` | HIGH |
| Deep nested access | `a.b.c.d.e` without default | MEDIUM |

---

## 4. MULE FLOW BUG PATTERNS

| Pattern | What to Check | Severity |
|---------|---------------|----------|
| Scatter-gather | Routes missing individual `<error-handler>` | HIGH |
| Choice condition | `sizeOf()` on XML (may not work) | HIGH |
| Flow initialState | Property key doesn't match flow name | HIGH |
| File name typo | `listner` instead of `listener` | HIGH |

---

## 5. ADDITIONAL BUG PATTERNS (Quick Reference)

| Pattern | Severity | How to Detect |
|---------|----------|---------------|
| Missing error handler | HIGH | Flow with external call but no `<error-handler>` |
| Hardcoded credentials | CRITICAL | `password=`, `secret=` with literals (not `${...}`) |
| No connection pool | HIGH | DB config missing `<pooling-profile>` |
| Missing/long timeout | HIGH | HTTP config without timeout or > 60s |
| Foreach variable overwrite | MEDIUM | `set-variable` inside `foreach` not accumulating |
| PII in logs | MEDIUM | `#[payload]` in logger message |
| O(n²) DataWeave | MEDIUM | `filter` inside `map` on large datasets |
| No input validation | MEDIUM | `http:listener` → DB/API without validation |

