## 9. TEST COVERAGE ANALYSIS

### Coverage Table Format

| Flow | Tests | Coverage | Status |
|------|-------|----------|--------|
| create-customer-flow | 4 | 72% | ⚠️ |
| get-customer-flow | 3 | 85% | ✅ |
| delete-customer-flow | 0 | 0% | ❌ |
| error-handler-flow | 0 | 0% | ❌ |

### What to Check

- How many test files exist?
- Which flows have NO tests?
- What scenarios are covered?
- What's the overall line coverage?

