## 11. MENTAL EXECUTION CHECKLIST

### Before Completing Phase 3 (EACH Pass)

- [ ] Every flow traced from entry to exit (full sweep)
- [ ] Every DataWeave transformation analyzed
- [ ] All array access patterns checked for null safety
- [ ] All filter results checked for empty array handling
- [ ] Type coercions verified with defaults
- [ ] Scatter-gather routes checked for individual handlers
- [ ] Choice conditions validated for correct types
- [ ] Flow names match initialState references
- [ ] File names checked for typos
- [ ] Error handlers present on all flows
- [ ] External calls have timeouts/retries
- [ ] Credentials externalized
- [ ] Test coverage calculated
- [ ] **All new findings tagged with current pass number**
- [ ] **Delta summary prepared (new vs cumulative)**
- [ ] **Convergence checked (zero new CRITICAL/MEDIUM?)**

### Before Completing Phase 4 (EACH Pass)

- [ ] All DataWeave mappings analyzed (full sweep)
- [ ] Source-to-target field mappings verified
- [ ] Type mismatches counted
- [ ] Null safety issues counted
- [ ] Coverage percentage calculated
- [ ] **All new mapping findings tagged with current pass number**
- [ ] **Delta summary prepared**
- [ ] **Convergence checked**

### Before Completing Phase 5

- [ ] All findings have id, severity, category, file, line, issue, impact, **pass**
- [ ] RGV Convergence Summary generated
- [ ] Score calculated with deductions (ALL passes cumulative)
- [ ] Grade determined
- [ ] Production decision made
- [ ] Blockers listed
- [ ] All placeholders replaced (including RGV placeholders)

