## 12. FINDINGS-ONLY RULES

### INCLUDE in Report

- Finding ID (CRITICAL-001, HIGH-001, etc.)
- Severity classification
- Category
- File path and line number
- Issue description
- Impact statement
- **Pass number** (which RGV pass discovered it)

### EXCLUDE from Report

- How to fix
- Code solutions
- Recommendations
- Action plans

### Format: Tables Over Text (with Pass column)

```markdown
❌ WRONG: "The account mapping has a potential null pointer issue..."

✅ RIGHT:
| ID | Severity | File | Line | Issue | Pass |
|----|----------|------|------|-------|------|
| CRITICAL-001 | CRITICAL | sap-to-sfdc-account-mapping.dwl | 101 | Array access without null check | 1 |
| CRITICAL-003 | CRITICAL | process-order-flow.xml | 52 | Null payload after scatter-gather timeout | 2 |
```

